<span class="ez-toc-title-toggle"><a href="#" class="ez-toc-pull-right ez-toc-btn ez-toc-btn-xs ez-toc-btn-default ez-toc-toggle" aria-label="Toggle Table of Content"><span class="ez-toc-js-icon-con"><span class=""><span class="eztoc-hide" style="display:none;">切換</span><span class="ez-toc-icon-toggle-span"><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="list-377408" width="20px" height="20px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 6H4v2h2V6zm14 0H8v2h12V6zM4 11h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2zM4 16h2v2H4v-2zm16 0H8v2h12v-2z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg style="fill: #999;color:#999" class="arrow-unsorted-368013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10px" height="10px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.2" baseProfile="tiny"><path d="M18.2 9.3l-6.2-6.3-6.2 6.3c-.2.2-.3.4-.3.7s.1.5.3.7c.2.2.4.3.7.3h11c.3 0 .5-.1.7-.3.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7zM5.8 14.7l6.2 6.3 6.2-6.3c.2-.2.3-.5.3-.7s-.1-.5-.3-.7c-.2-.2-.4-.3-.7-.3h-11c-.3 0-.5.1-.7.3-.2.2-.3.5-.3.7s.1.5.3.7z"/></svg></span></span></span></a></span></div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1" href="#Is_Quinoa_Chametz" >是藜麥查梅茲嗎?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2" href="#What_Is_Chametz" >查梅茲是什麼?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3" href="#Why_Quinoa_Is_Not_Chametz" >為什麼藜麥不是 Chametz</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4" href="#Key_Reasons_Quinoa_Is_Not_Chametz" >藜麥不是 Chametz 的主要原因:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5" href="#Common_Uses_of_Quinoa_%E2%80%93_Kosher_Passover_Friendly" >藜麥的常見用途 - 猶太潔食 &amp; 逾越節友好</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6" href="#Quinoa_vs_Chametz_Full_Comparison_Table" >藜麥對比. 查梅茨: 完整比較表</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Buying_Quinoa_for_Passover_%E2%80%93_What_to_Look_For" >逾越節購買藜麥－要注意什麼</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#Related_FAQ" >相關常見問題</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#Final_Thoughts" >最後的想法</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="169" data-end="430"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Is_Quinoa_Chametz"></span>是藜麥查梅茲嗎?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="169" data-end="430"><strong>不, <a href="/zh-tw/dinweys-bulk-quinoa/">藜麥</a> 不是查梅茲</strong>. 它不是五種發酵穀物之一 (發酵的) 根據猶太法律，逾越節期間禁止. 然而, 由於潛在的交叉污染，藜麥必須獲得“逾越節猶太潔食”認證.</p><p data-start="432" data-end="548">但查梅茲到底是什麼? 為什麼藜麥可以豁免? 逾越節及以後如何使用藜麥? 讓我們來探索一下.</p><hr data-start="550" data-end="553" /><h2 data-start="555" data-end="577"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Is_Chametz"></span>查梅茲是什麼?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="579" data-end="766"><strong data-start="579" data-end="590">查梅茨</strong> (酵) 指由五種特定穀物製成的任何食品，與水接觸並發酵超過 18 分鐘. 這些穀物是:</p><ul data-start="768" data-end="815"><li data-start="768" data-end="777"><p data-start="770" data-end="777">小麥</p></li><li data-start="778" data-end="788"><p data-start="780" data-end="788">大麥</p></li><li data-start="789" data-end="796"><p data-start="791" data-end="796">黑麥</p></li><li data-start="797" data-end="805"><p data-start="799" data-end="805">燕麥</p></li><li data-start="806" data-end="815"><p data-start="808" data-end="815">斯佩爾特</p></li></ul><p data-start="817" data-end="1030">在此期間禁止使用這些穀物發酵的任何東西 <strong data-start="873" data-end="894">逾越節 (逾越節)</strong> 根據哈拉查 (猶太法). 這包括麵包, 義大利麵, 穀物, 和許多加工食品，除非它們經過逾越節認證.</p><hr data-start="1032" data-end="1035" /><h2 data-start="1037" data-end="1068"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Why_Quinoa_Is_Not_Chametz"></span>為什麼藜麥不是 Chametz<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1070" data-end="1264">藜麥 (藜麥) 從植物學上來說根本不是穀物. 這是一個 <strong data-start="1140" data-end="1157">偽穀物</strong> 來自南美洲, 屬於 <strong data-start="1195" data-end="1214">莧菜科</strong>, 與小麥和其他 chametz 穀物無關.</p><h3 data-start="1266" data-end="1304"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Key_Reasons_Quinoa_Is_Not_Chametz"></span>藜麥不是 Chametz 的主要原因:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="1306" data-end="1476"><li data-start="1306" data-end="1346"><p data-start="1308" data-end="1346">❌ 不是五種 chametz 穀物之一</p></li><li data-start="1347" data-end="1401"><p data-start="1349" data-end="1401">❌ 與水混合時不會自然發酵</p></li><li data-start="1402" data-end="1429"><p data-start="1404" data-end="1429">✅ 天然不含麩質</p></li><li data-start="1430" data-end="1476"><p data-start="1432" data-end="1476">✅ 在適當監督下被認為是猶太潔食</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="1478" data-end="1841"><p data-start="1480" data-end="1506"><strong data-start="1480" data-end="1505">權威來源</strong>:</p><ul data-start="1509" data-end="1841"><li data-start="1509" data-end="1612"><p data-start="1511" data-end="1612"><strong data-start="1511" data-end="1535">東正教聯盟 (或者):</strong> “藜麥不是 chametz，經過適當認證後可以在逾越節使用。”</p></li><li data-start="1615" data-end="1735"><p data-start="1617" data-end="1735"><strong data-start="1617" data-end="1628">星K:</strong> 「如果在確保不被 Chametz 污染的設施中進行加工，藜麥就是逾越節的猶太潔食。”</p></li><li data-start="1738" data-end="1841"><p data-start="1740" data-end="1841"><strong data-start="1740" data-end="1788">拉比大會 (保守運動):</strong> 在監督下宣布逾越節藜麥符合猶太潔食標準.</p></li></ul></blockquote><hr data-start="1843" data-end="1846" /><h2 data-start="1848" data-end="1904"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Common_Uses_of_Quinoa_%E2%80%93_Kosher_Passover_Friendly"></span>藜麥的常見用途 - 猶太潔食 &amp; 逾越節友好<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="1906" data-end="2057">藜麥用途極為廣泛，在逾越節期間作為一種高蛋白在猶太家庭中越來越受歡迎, 無麩質替代品. 典型用途包括:</p><ul data-start="2059" data-end="2245"><li data-start="2059" data-end="2095"><p data-start="2061" data-end="2095">煮藜麥沙拉或配菜</p></li><li data-start="2096" data-end="2151"><p data-start="2098" data-end="2151">用於逾越節烘焙的藜麥粉 (認證的)</p></li><li data-start="2152" data-end="2196"><p data-start="2154" data-end="2196">藜麥早餐碗 (含水果/堅果)</p></li><li data-start="2197" data-end="2245"><p data-start="2199" data-end="2245">能量棒和格蘭諾拉麥片 (逾越節認證)</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2247" data-end="2250" /><h2 data-start="2252" data-end="2299"><img src="/images/Is-Quinoa-Chametz.jpg" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-1168 size-full" alt="Is Quinoa Chametz" width="1200" height="800" title="是藜麥查梅茲嗎? 3" /></h2><h2 data-start="2252" data-end="2299"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Quinoa_vs_Chametz_Full_Comparison_Table"></span>藜麥對比. 查梅茨: 完整比較表<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="_tableContainer_16hzy_1"><div class="_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="2301" data-end="3205"><thead data-start="2301" data-end="2398"><tr data-start="2301" data-end="2398"><th data-start="2301" data-end="2326" data-col-size="sm">特徵</th><th data-start="2326" data-end="2358" data-col-size="sm">查梅茨 (5 穀物)</th><th data-start="2358" data-end="2398" data-col-size="sm">藜麥 (藜麥)</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="2499" data-end="3205"><tr data-start="2499" data-end="2599"><td data-start="2499" data-end="2525" data-col-size="sm">哈拉奇狀態</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2525" data-end="2557">查梅茨 (逾越節禁止)</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2557" data-end="2599">不是查梅茲 (如果經過認證則允許)</td></tr><tr data-start="2600" data-end="2700"><td data-start="2600" data-end="2626" data-col-size="sm">顆粒類型</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2626" data-end="2658">真粒</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2658" data-end="2700">偽穀物</td></tr><tr data-start="2701" data-end="2801"><td data-start="2701" data-end="2727" data-col-size="sm">麩質含量</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2727" data-end="2759">是的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2759" data-end="2801">不 (天然無麩質)</td></tr><tr data-start="2802" data-end="2902"><td data-start="2802" data-end="2828" data-col-size="sm">共同來源</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2828" data-end="2860">中東, 歐洲</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2860" data-end="2902">南美洲, 中國</td></tr><tr data-start="2903" data-end="3003"><td data-start="2903" data-end="2929" data-col-size="sm">發酵潛力</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2929" data-end="2961">高的</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="2961" data-end="3003">沒有任何</td></tr><tr data-start="3004" data-end="3104"><td data-start="3004" data-end="3030" data-col-size="sm">逾越節猶太潔食?</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3030" data-end="3062">不 (除非做無酵餅)</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3062" data-end="3104">是的 (必須經過認證)</td></tr><tr data-start="3105" data-end="3205"><td data-start="3105" data-end="3131" data-col-size="sm">流行用途</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3131" data-end="3163">麵包, 粉麵, 啤酒</td><td data-col-size="sm" data-start="3163" data-end="3205">沙拉, 烘烤, 無麩質食品</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"></div></div></div></div><hr data-start="3207" data-end="3210" /><h2 data-start="3212" data-end="3263"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Buying_Quinoa_for_Passover_%E2%80%93_What_to_Look_For"></span>逾越節購買藜麥－要注意什麼<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3265" data-end="3319">用於個人或大量購買, 請務必檢查:</p><ul data-start="3321" data-end="3498"><li data-start="3321" data-end="3398"><p data-start="3323" data-end="3398">✅ &#8220;逾越節猶太潔食&#8221; 來自著名拉比權威的認證</p></li><li data-start="3399" data-end="3449"><p data-start="3401" data-end="3449">📦 包裝乾淨，無交叉污染</p></li><li data-start="3450" data-end="3498"><p data-start="3452" data-end="3498">🧼 烹調前適當清洗分類</p></li></ul><p data-start="3500" data-end="3562">為了 <strong data-start="3504" data-end="3547">大宗進口商和國際買家</strong>, 我們推薦:</p><ul data-start="3564" data-end="3802"><li data-start="3564" data-end="3620"><p data-start="3566" data-end="3620"><strong data-start="3566" data-end="3577">起源:</strong> 秘魯 / 玻利維亞 / 中國 (認證農場)</p></li><li data-start="3621" data-end="3673"><p data-start="3623" data-end="3673"><strong data-start="3623" data-end="3635">包裝:</strong> 25公斤編織袋或零售包裝</p></li><li data-start="3674" data-end="3749"><p data-start="3676" data-end="3749"><strong data-start="3676" data-end="3705">可獲得認證:</strong> 猶太潔食 (包括逾越節), 有機的, COA</p></li><li data-start="3750" data-end="3802"><p data-start="3752" data-end="3802"><strong data-start="3752" data-end="3760">起訂量:</strong> 從 1 噸, 提供客製化品牌</p></li></ul><p data-start="3804" data-end="3870">📩 聯絡我們取得批發價格和完整規格表.</p><hr data-start="3872" data-end="3875" /><h2 data-start="3877" data-end="3893"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Related_FAQ"></span>相關常見問題<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3895" data-end="4050"><strong data-start="3895" data-end="3936">1. 逾越節的藜麥都是猶太潔食嗎?</strong><br data-start="3936" data-end="3939" />未必. 僅在無 Chametz 的設施中加工並貼有標籤的藜麥 &#8220;逾越節猶太潔食&#8221; 被允許.</p><p data-start="4052" data-end="4193"><strong data-start="4052" data-end="4089">2. 藜麥被認為是基尼約特嗎?</strong><br data-start="4089" data-end="4092" />一些德系猶太人當局最初認為它是 kitniyot, 但現在許多人在獲得認證後允許這樣做.</p><p data-start="4195" data-end="4315"><strong data-start="4195" data-end="4241">3. 藜麥可以像 Chametz 穀物一樣發酵嗎?</strong><br data-start="4241" data-end="4244" />不. 與水混合時不發生自然發酵.</p><p data-start="4317" data-end="4443"><strong data-start="4317" data-end="4367">4. 藜麥粉適合逾越節烘焙嗎?</strong><br data-start="4367" data-end="4370" />是的, 如果經過認證. 它用於蛋糕和無酵麵包的替代品.</p><p data-start="4445" data-end="4564"><strong data-start="4445" data-end="4488">5. 逾越節最好的藜麥是什麼?</strong><br data-start="4488" data-end="4491" />白藜麥因其溫和的風味和清潔的加工而最受歡迎.</p><hr data-start="4566" data-end="4569" /><h2 data-start="4571" data-end="4591"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Final_Thoughts"></span>最後的想法<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="4593" data-end="4893"><strong data-start="4593" data-end="4653">藜麥是一種強大的逾越節友好穀物替代品</strong>, 適合無麩質, 高蛋白飲食, 和遵守猶太潔食的消費者. 隨著全球需求的快速成長, 尤其是在逾越節期間, 對於進口商和品牌來說，將經過認證的藜麥添加到他們的產品線中是明智的選擇.</p><p data-start="4895" data-end="5044">想要探索猶太潔食或有機食品市場的批發藜麥選擇?<br data-start="4971" data-end="4974" />👉 <a class="" href="/zh-tw/products/" rel="noopener" data-start="4977" data-end="5044">點擊此處查看我們的藜麥產品頁面並索取報價</a></p>`} />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
